===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|en|enm|born}}, {{m|enm|boren}}, {{m|enm|borne}}, {{m|enm|iborne}}, from {{inh|en|ang|boren}}, {{m|ang|ġeboren}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*boran}}, {{m|gmw-pro|*gaboran}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*buranaz}}, [[past participle]] of {{der|en|gem-pro|*beraną|t=to bear, carry}}, equivalent to {{af|en|bear|-en}}. Cognate with {{cog|stq|gebooren|t=born}}, {{cog|fy|berne|t=born}}, {{cog|nl|geboren|t=born}}, {{cog|de|geboren|t=born}}, {{cog|sv|boren|t=born}}.

